## PR Trigger Configuration

- Target main and dev branches
- Workflow run completion triggers
- Manual workflow dispatch support
- Branch protection rule integration
- Quality gate enforcement automatic
- Review requirement coordination

```yaml
# PR workflow triggers
on:
  pull_request:
    branches:
      - main
      - dev
  workflow_dispatch:
```

## Pre-Review Automation

- Cache preparation job execution
- Flutter SDK caching implementation
- Pub dependencies optimization
- Dart analysis pre-warming
- 15-minute timeout for preparation
- Parallel job execution setup

## Integration Testing Pipeline

- Android emulator setup automation
- KVM permissions configuration
- AVD snapshot caching strategy
- API level 30 standard
- Hardware acceleration optimization
- Headless execution for reliability

```yaml
# Android emulator setup
- name: Enable KVM group perms
  run: |
    echo 'KERNEL=="kvm", GROUP="kvm", MODE="0666"' | sudo tee /etc/udev/rules.d/99-kvm4all.rules
    sudo udevadm control --reload-rules
```

## Build Verification Process

- Android APK debug build
- Java 17 environment setup
- Gradle caching optimization
- Build number from GitHub run
- APK size verification (100MB limit)
- Artifact retention management

## Quality Gate Requirements

- All pre-commit hooks must pass
- Integration tests must succeed completely
- Android build must complete successfully
- No security vulnerabilities detected
- Coverage thresholds must be met
- Documentation completeness verified

## Review Checklist Standards

- Code follows established architecture patterns
- Tests cover new functionality adequately
- Security considerations addressed properly
- Performance impact assessed
- Documentation updated when required
- Breaking changes documented clearly

## Automated Validation Steps

- Cache restoration from prepare job
- Dependencies resolution verification
- Integration test execution
- APK build and verification
- Artifact upload for review
- Success status reporting

```yaml
# Build verification
- name: Build Android APK
  run: flutter build apk --debug --build-number=${{ github.run_number }}
```

## Reviewer Responsibilities

- Architecture compliance verification
- Code quality assessment
- Test coverage evaluation
- Security vulnerability review
- Performance impact analysis
- Documentation accuracy check

## PR Approval Criteria

- All automated checks pass
- Code review approval received
- Integration tests successful
- Build artifacts generated successfully
- No merge conflicts present
- Branch up to date requirements

## Merge Requirements

- PR status checks successful
- Required reviews obtained
- No outstanding change requests
- Branch protection rules satisfied
- All conversations resolved
- Final integration test pass

## Post-Review Actions

- Successful merge triggers deployment
- Branch cleanup automation
- Release preparation if applicable
- Documentation updates deployment
- Team notifications sent
- Metrics collection for improvement

## Emergency Procedures

- Hotfix branch exception handling
- Critical security fix fast-track
- Production issue emergency response
- Bypass procedures documentation
- Post-emergency review requirements
- Process improvement identification

## Review Performance Metrics

- Time from PR to approval
- Integration test pass rate
- Build success rate tracking
- Review iteration count
- Merge conflict frequency
- Quality gate effectiveness

## Collaboration Guidelines

- Clear PR description requirements
- Link to related issues
- Demonstrate testing performed
- Explain architectural decisions
- Request specific reviewer attention
- Respond to feedback promptly

```yaml
# PR integration success indicator
- name: All checks passed
  run: |
    echo "✅ All CI checks passed successfully"
    echo "- Integration Tests: Passed"
    echo "- Android Build: Passed"
```